omy last  year after a c-section like nothing  really feels to me like that big of a  deal Amy also reveals a battle with  trichotillomania a form of OCD where  patients pull out their own hair it's  still humiliating and shameful I still  struggle with it  you're still doing it luckily I have  hair extensions and it's the only reason  I can be on camera other stars not  holding back Jane Fonda who recently  announced her remission from cancer and  talks about her recovery from a past  eating disorder if I had anything too  over and it was nowadays right I'd  probably go to a 12-step program or  something Nick Cannon explained the  despair felt when he lost his  five-month-old son Zen to a rare form of  brain cancer just over a year ago that  last weekend I kind of knew like this is  probably going to be the last weekend  luckily we had did everything from  the sunrise and going to the beach and  you know the sunset I'm grateful for  that in October Zen's mom Alyssa Scott  announced they're expecting another  child together Nick has also been  dealing with his own health struggles  last month Nick was hospitalized with  the pneumonia he also battles the  autoimmune disease lupus which nearly  took his life he went into kidney  failure and had a blood clot in his lung  and several times came close to dying  from them once he learned he's  preventing them and he's in remarkable  shape now Oprah is hoping to inform  others about the sometimes terrifying  symptoms of menopause I was like  severely palpitating  and every night I have journals filled  with I don't know if I'll make it till  the morning I thought I was going to die  every single night this is a natural  transition so she's heroic to be so  vulnerable with what she went through  [Music]
 

